# Default Hormuz OCI releases start from an empty context. This Dockerfile-
# specific allowlist takes precedence over .dockerignore, whose extra tools are
# required only by the separate Ceph conformance image.
**
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!requirements/
!requirements/oci-build-linux-amd64.lock
!requirements/oci-runtime-linux-amd64.lock
!hormuz/
!hormuz/**
